Step 08.7 part 6: observable-dispatch engineering demo
Scope: compare oracle-label dispatch with observable dispatch. Observable dispatch does not use beta/phase/rho/el_true/el_diff as inputs. No fullscan, no V2, no complex-gain q, no 4D search, no edits to step 8.6 or prior step 8.7 outputs.
Geometry: Q=65, Nel=32, theta_sep=0.263775445 deg.
Run control: Metkl=30, SNR=[0 8 16], T_snap=260, sep_factor=10.
Metkl is reduced from 50 to 30 because part 5 already covered the boundary trend and part 6 only validates dispatch feasibility.
2D MUSIC K=[20,8], pair-local covfit K=[6,3], refocus_el_grid=29.
Scenario count=51. Groups: reduced rho scan, beta scan, phase scan, large elevation general cases.
